<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell 14 points to 1,467.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell 14 points to 1,467.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,467 today from 1,481 on April 3, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1477    13.406	  1484    13.475</p>
<p>   1a   1474 11163.000	  1489 11275.000</p>
<p>   2    1769    25.276	  1787    25.531</p>
<p>   2a   1816 14894.000	  1834 15044.000</p>
<p>   3    1714    15.813	  1738    16.038</p>
</text>
